{"seq":3,"slug":"voronoi-fracture","title":"Voronoi 断裂","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/destruction-systems/foundations/voronoi-fracture","wordCount":1705,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"voronoi-断裂\">Voronoi 断裂</h1><p>把一块完整网格切成一堆「看起来像真碎掉」的碎片，业界几乎一致的答案是 Voronoi 图。从 Houdini 的 Voronoi Fracture SOP、到 Unreal Chaos 的 Voronoi 断裂模式、再到几乎每篇破坏教程，它都是默认起点。原因很朴素：Voronoi 单元天然形成不规则的凸多面体，恰好接近混凝土、岩石、陶瓷这类材料的真实碎块形状。本篇是整个 hub 唯一详述切割算法的地方——后面任何文档说到「切碎」，默认就是这里的方法。我们从 Voronoi 图的数学讲起，到怎么把它落成可控、像真材料的碎片。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-voronoi-图与碎片的对应\">核心概念：Voronoi 图与碎片的对应</h2><p>给定空间中一组点（称为种子点 / sites）<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{p_1, p_2, \\dots, p_n\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>，每个种子点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的 <strong>Voronoi 单元</strong> 是空间中所有「离 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 比离任何其他种子点都近」的点的集合：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>:</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi><mi>j</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V(p_i) = \\{ x : \\|x - p_i\\| \\le \\|x - p_j\\|, \\ \\forall j \\neq i \\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∀</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>两个相邻种子点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 之间，那些到两者等距的点构成它们连线的<strong>垂直平分面</strong>；每个 Voronoi 单元就是被这些半空间相交切出来的凸多面体。把这组单元和待破坏网格求交，每个单元落在网格内部的部分就是一块碎片。种子点的分布直接决定碎片的大小、形状与分布——这是整套方法可控性的来源。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[待破坏网格] --&gt; B[在体内撒种子点]&#10;  B --&gt; C[每对相邻种子&lt;br/&gt;取垂直平分面]&#10;  C --&gt; D[半空间相交&lt;br/&gt;得到凸多面体单元]&#10;  D --&gt; E[单元与网格求交]&#10;  E --&gt; F[每个单元内部=一块碎片]&#10;  F --&gt; G[生成内表面+UV+碰撞代理]\">graph TD\n  A[待破坏网格] --&gt; B[在体内撒种子点]\n  B --&gt; C[每对相邻种子&lt;br/&gt;取垂直平分面]\n  C --&gt; D[半空间相交&lt;br/&gt;得到凸多面体单元]\n  D --&gt; E[单元与网格求交]\n  E --&gt; F[每个单元内部=一块碎片]\n  F --&gt; G[生成内表面+UV+碰撞代理]</pre><p>为什么是凸多面体？因为 Voronoi 单元由有限个半空间相交而成，半空间的交一定是凸的。这对物理模拟是天大的好事：凸形状的碰撞检测远比凹形状快、稳，碎块可以直接用单元本身做碰撞代理（碰撞细节见 <a href=\"../simulation/rigid-body-debris\">刚体碎块</a>）。这也是 Voronoi 几乎压倒其他切割法（如纯布尔随机切）的关键工程理由。</p>\n<h2 id=\"种子点分布-控制碎裂图案的旋钮\">种子点分布：控制碎裂图案的旋钮</h2><p>碎片好不好看，几乎全由种子点怎么撒决定。均匀随机撒点会得到大小杂乱的碎块，常常不像真实材料。实战里通过控制种子分布来塑造碎裂风格：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>均匀散布（uniform scatter）</strong>：种子在体内大致均匀分布，得到大小相近的碎块，适合混凝土、石膏。</li>\n<li><strong>聚簇散布（clustered）</strong>：在受击点附近加密种子、远处稀疏，模拟「击中处碎得细、外围碎得粗」的真实冲击效果。</li>\n<li><strong>沿应力/纹理散布</strong>：让种子分布跟随材料纹理或预设应力线，木头顺纹理、玻璃呈放射状。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>下表把常见材料和对应的种子策略与后处理对上号：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>材料</th>\n<th>种子分布</th>\n<th>碎块特征</th>\n<th>关键后处理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>混凝土</td>\n<td>均匀 + 受击点加密</td>\n<td>不规则中等块，带「钢筋」</td>\n<td>内表面噪声、二次细分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>玻璃</td>\n<td>受击点放射状</td>\n<td>细长放射裂片</td>\n<td>薄壳、边缘锐化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>木头</td>\n<td>沿纹理拉伸的各向异性</td>\n<td>顺纹理长条</td>\n<td>纤维状内表面</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>岩石</td>\n<td>均匀 + 大小随机</td>\n<td>大小悬殊的块</td>\n<td>强噪声、风化感</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>控制种子密度还直接控制碎片数量——这是性能的命门。种子越多碎片越多、物理越贵，所以种子数本质上是一个性能旋钮（预算见 <a href=\"../practice/performance-budget-destruction\">性能预算</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多级断裂与内表面生成\">多级断裂与内表面生成</h2><p>单层 Voronoi 往往不够真实，现代破坏管线普遍用<strong>嵌套 / 多级断裂（nested fracture）</strong>：先用较少种子做一层粗切，再对每个碎块用 For-Each 循环做一次种子更少的二级 Voronoi，得到「大块可以再碎成小块」的层级结构。这层级正好对应运行时的 Clustering——粗切层是「大块」，细切层是「小块」，承受足够冲击时大块才解体成小块（见 <a href=\"../systems/chaos-physics-destruction\">混沌物理破坏系统</a> 与结构传播 <a href=\"../simulation/constraints-structural\">结构约束与连接</a>）。</p>\n<p>切割还有一个容易被忽视但对观感至关重要的环节：<strong>内表面生成</strong>。原始网格只有外表面，切开后新暴露的截面是「内表面」，必须为它生成几何、法线和 UV，否则碎块内部会是空洞或拉伸贴图。2026 年成熟管线的做法是：用 Voronoi 选出内表面，重新网格化（remesh），叠加程序化噪声制造粗糙断面，再做 UV 展开并赋予专门的「断面材质」（混凝土露出骨料、木头露出纤维）。这一步是「碎块看着像真材料」与「看着像塑料假货」的分水岭。</p>\n<h2 id=\"算法实现与-gpu-趋势\">算法实现与 GPU 趋势</h2><p>精确构造 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个种子的 Voronoi 图，经典做法是先求其对偶——<strong>Delaunay 三角化</strong>，再取对偶得到 Voronoi 单元；三维下也可用「逐半空间裁剪」的直接法：对每个种子，用它与所有邻居的垂直平分面依次裁剪一个初始大盒子，剩下的凸多面体就是该单元。后者实现简单、易并行，是很多游戏向工具的选择。</p>\n<p>复杂度方面，三维 Voronoi 图的单元总数最坏可达 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，但对游戏里常见的较均匀种子分布，实际接近线性，几百到上千个种子完全可控。</p>\n<p>实现上有两个工程要点。其一，纯离线切割（预断裂）对性能不敏感，可以追求高质量；动态运行时切割则必须严控种子数并尽量并行（见 <a href=\"prefractured-vs-dynamic\">预断裂与动态</a>）。其二，2026 年的趋势是把切割与后处理搬上 GPU：Houdini 与定制管线越来越多地用计算着色器并行做半空间裁剪、噪声叠加与碰撞代理生成，把原本几秒的离线切割压到接近实时，让「编辑器里实时预览不同种子分布的碎法」成为常态，大幅加快美术迭代（流程见 <a href=\"../practice/authoring-destruction\">制作流程</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Voronoi 图把空间按「最近种子点」划分成凸多面体单元，与网格求交即得碎片；凸性让碰撞检测又快又稳，是它成为业界标准的核心理由。</li>\n<li>种子点分布是碎裂图案的总旋钮：均匀、受击点聚簇、沿纹理/应力散布分别对应混凝土、玻璃、木头等材料；种子数同时是性能旋钮。</li>\n<li>多级嵌套断裂产出「大块再碎小块」的层级，直接喂给运行时 Clustering；内表面生成（重网格 + 噪声 + UV + 断面材质）决定碎块像真材料还是像塑料。</li>\n<li>实现可走 Delaunay 对偶或逐半空间裁剪；2026 年趋势是 GPU 并行切割，让编辑器实时预览碎法、加速美术迭代。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>前置决策：<a href=\"prefractured-vs-dynamic\">预断裂与动态</a>；全局：<a href=\"destruction-overview\">破坏系统概览</a></li>\n<li>碎片去哪了：<a href=\"../simulation/rigid-body-debris\">刚体碎块</a>；层级如何传播断裂：<a href=\"../simulation/constraints-structural\">结构约束与连接</a></li>\n<li>跨库：碎块凸包碰撞依赖窄相检测，见游戏物理 hub 的 <a href=\"../../game-physics/collision-detection/narrow-phase\">窄相碰撞检测</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Voronoi 断裂","id":"voronoi-断裂"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：Voronoi 图与碎片的对应","id":"核心概念-voronoi-图与碎片的对应"},{"level":2,"text":"种子点分布：控制碎裂图案的旋钮","id":"种子点分布-控制碎裂图案的旋钮"},{"level":2,"text":"多级断裂与内表面生成","id":"多级断裂与内表面生成"},{"level":2,"text":"算法实现与 GPU 趋势","id":"算法实现与-gpu-趋势"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"预断裂与动态","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/destruction-systems/foundations/prefractured-vs-dynamic"},"next":{"title":"刚体碎块","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/destruction-systems/simulation/rigid-body-debris"}}